WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
A list needs commas so the reader can tell where one thing stops and the next begins.

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:08.690
Rice, cotton, and corn.

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:13.480
Without the commas, you might read rice cotton as one thing.

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:19.200
Put a comma after every item but the last, and keep the one before and.
